WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.029 --> 00:00:10.860
Let's pray together as we seek the holiness of God and Him

2
00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:12.220
producing it in our hearts.

3
00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:14.720
Father, your holiness

4
00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:19.120
is so much bigger and deeper than we ever knew.

5
00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.040
I praise you, Lord, that there is more layers and more

6
00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:27.620
depth and more beauty in your holiness, always

7
00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:28.960
more to be discovered.

8
00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:32.780
Lord, we're desperate. We're desperate to go there.

9
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:36.680
We're desperate to see the beauty of your character and the moral

10
00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:40.600
goodness of your being. But only you can take us to the place

11
00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:42.500
where we can see it clearly for what it is.

12
00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:46.020
So Lord, I pray that you would do it today.

13
00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:50.580
Lord, I pray that you would take me and my prayer partner here

14
00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:51.840
with us today, and that you would

15
00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:56.640
plunge us deeper and deeper into who you

16
00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:00.660
are, Lord. I pray that you would not just keep us around the

17
00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:04.110
edges of your holiness, barely in contact with you,

18
00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:08.400
barely transformed by the glory of your beauty and moral

19
00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:12.220
purity, but that you would take us deep into the heart of

20
00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:15.680
God, down into the core in the hottest part of the fire,

21
00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:19.760
Lord. Take us to the place where we shine and we glow with

22
00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:23.600
the glory of your holiness in ways we never thought we

23
00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:27.380
could. Lord, there's so much darkness in our world, in our

24
00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:30.100
background, in our family, in our nature.

25
00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:33.580
Oh, we need to glow with the glory of your holiness.

26
00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:37.580
Lord, help us there in that place as we go deeper with you.

27
00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:42.100
We know that deeper levels of holiness are needed, deeper levels of holiness are

28
00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:46.210
possible. So Lord, we just launch out

29
00:01:46.300 --> 00:01:48.680
and we launched ourselves deep into your character.

30
00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:52.760
And we pray, O God, that you would reproduce yourself in us.

31
00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:56.520
Teach us, O Lord, to know the difference between the holy

32
00:01:56.920 --> 00:02:00.700
and the common. Teach us to know the difference between the holy and that which

33
00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:04.660
is impure, and make us find there in the depths of

34
00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:07.940
your holiness, new levels of joy and usefulness and

35
00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:11.800
power and victory in you. We pray in Jesus' name.

36
00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:14.580
Let's continue seeking God together.
